Z||000019||Jhonny||11-08-2001||02:39 AM||||The internal design of this muffler are supposed to force the exhaust gases into a<BR>tornado like shape thus creating s suction in<BR>the exhaust system. The suction helps to empty the cylinders from exhaust gases more effectively.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.rakaror.o.se/SPORTAVGASSYSTEM.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rakaror.o.se/SPORTAVGASSYSTEM.html</A> <P>If it works I can't tell only that it looks good !!!<P>/// Jhonny<P>------------------<BR>Jhonny Sokura<BR>Vadstena, Östergötland Sweden<P><A HREF="http://home.swipnet.se/jks/fiero3.jpg" TARGET=_blank> Pontiac Fiero GT -87 , V6 5spd<BR> </A>||||reg||1
